    "body": "# What data do we want?\r\n\r\nMost data related with our audience/page view. For example,\r\n\r\n- When do your users visit?\r\n- Where are your users?\r\n- What pages do your users visit?\r\n- How are your active users trending over time?\r\n- What are your top devices?\r\n\r\n# Why do we need that data?\r\n\r\n1. To provide numbers for funders\r\n2. To assist when making decisions\r\n\r\n# Why do we need to review it uses?\r\n\r\nAlthough we collect the data, isn't clear who is the gate keeper for it. Most of the data that we collect with Google Analytics could make public and avoid maintainers and other volunteers to ask around how to access that data.",
